--- !yfi/header
version: 1
namespace: brute::open
visibility: public
mutability: mutable
---
# The target a `brute` has nothing to force against: this scope grants the
# write, so the member that forces it forces nothing and the compiler says
# nothing. Forcing is recorded where it takes effect (D6.4b), and here it does
# not take effect.
Open: !type &Open
  pub size: !!int 1
